      {
        "id": "prototype-checklist",
        "moduleId": "practice-and-wrap",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "写原型时的检查清单",
        "markdown": "写原型时可以按下面的清单自查：\n\n- 从定义首行照抄返回类型、函数名、参数类型和顺序；\n- 末尾补分号，绝不带函数体；\n- 形参名可省略或改名，但参数类型不能省；\n- 确保声明出现在所有调用之前；\n- 若定义已在调用之前，或已在文件开头作外部声明，则无需重复声明；\n- 修改函数定义时同步修改原型，避免两处不一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "declaration-vs-definition",
            "prototype-header",
            "prototype-check-rules"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "prototype-debug-exercise",
        "moduleId": "practice-and-wrap",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "改错练习：不一致的原型",
        "markdown": "下面的程序片段在 `main` 中调用 `average`，但原型与定义不一致。指出问题并改正：\n\n```c\n#include <stdio.h>\nint main()\n{\n    float average(float, float, float);\n    float r = average(80.0, 90.0);\n    printf(\"%f\", r);\n    return 0;\n}\nfloat average(float a, float b)\n{\n    return (a + b) / 2;\n}\n```\n\n原型声明了三个 `float` 形参，调用只提供两个实参，定义也只有两个形参。修正后的原型应与定义首部一致：\n\n```c\nfloat average(float, float);\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "prototype-checklist",
            "prototype-check-rules"
          ]
        }
      }
